                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There are multiple things that make this game enjoyabe. This includes the stunning simplistic style of the visuals, a nice soundtrack and a innovative puzzle mechanic. \n\nBut these things are not enough for you to invest the amount the developers are asking for, unless it is on sale, in which it may be worth spending a couple of dollars for.\n\nThe game is extremely short, the puzzles are far too easy and the music cuts in and out so awkwardly that it almost makes the soothing and relaxing soundtrack almost unbareable to listen to.  \n",
